    'Plan, Vashnik: the raid markers are its only picture (the guide\'s Plague Froth line and the Imbibe spot). The Lost Explorers: only the raid markers picture too. Nek\'zali: only the raid markers, Hungering Pyre and the well teams. Ula\'tek: no pictures for the egg carriers, Doomscale kick teams or off-tank jobs.',
