    'A polish pass over the whole site: nothing you read is under 12 px any more (tags, labels, the timeline lanes, the Report card and Graphs headers), the tab bars on a phone fade at the edge to show they scroll, and the empty Plan page sits with a little more air.',
    'Fairer Mythic checks on Twin Fangs, Sszorak, Vashnik, Entombed Sentinels, The Lost Explorers, Nymrissa and Ula\'tek: things top guilds do and still kill the boss are a note or yellow now, and red is kept for what kills someone or wipes the raid (checked against the fastest kills).',
    'A new death reason, Not enough healing: when someone did their part (no avoidable damage, nothing of theirs left unused) but sat under 40% health with little healing coming in for longer than top raids ever allow, the death isn\'t put on them. Healers see it on their Report card as a fact, never graded.',
    'Debriefing: the Coiled Altar shield-damage bars read like the site\'s other charts, one slim row a raider with a thin bar under the name, and the Venomfang dispel rows match them.',
    'The Coiled Altar: open Eternal Nightfall or Dreadmarch on Debriefing to see who put damage into the shields (Veil of Twilight and the mind-control shields), with how long each Veil took to break next to the top kills. On one pull or All pulls.',
    'Rotation says DPS and HPS instead of "a second" (overhealing, cooldown windows, Tyrant, Inner Flame, Tree of Life).',
    'Rotation: the Healing a second (or Damage a second) box leaves the top, since those numbers now live in the gear column, and the ✓ Done right chips sit under your talents, so the two top boxes end level.',
    'Rotation for healers: a Healing box in Gear and extras, like the damage dealers\' Boss and adds: your healing a second with your total and share of the raid\'s healing, and how much of what you cast overhealed.',
    'Rotation: Where your healing (or damage) came from sits full width above the two columns, and the pull-at-a-glance timeline drops its hint row and lists the red "ready for a whole extra use" first in its legend.',
    'Rotation: Other gear and Extras sit at the bottom of the gear column again instead of in a second panel under the checklist.',
    'Rotation: one tile a spell. Rows about the same spell sit in its tile (Judgment while Holy Shock was full in Holy Shock, what you saved for Incarnation in Incarnation), each tile leads with the spell\'s own uses, and the numbers tiles join their spell.',
    'Healers: Cooldowns on big damage counts your presses against the most you could have pressed, says how many met heavy damage, and its cards are your presses only.',
    'Rotation for healers: Mana at the kill now sits inside Mana in numbers, one tile with how much you had left and where it went, and a new From others bar shows the mana other players gave you (Innervate, Source of Magic, Symbol of Hope, Mana Tide) and who gave it.',
    'Rotation: Holy Power wasted now sits inside Holy Power in numbers (and Soul Shards wasted inside Soul Shards in numbers for Demonology): one tile with the grade, the sentence and the numbers.',
