// ---- Raid cooldown plan, power-matched (Oct 23, your asks: "The auto assign healing cooldown button needs better logic", "how much a
// healing cooldown is capable of doing ... to get through tough moments is probably one of if not the most important", "Strength, Duration,
// Cooldown, What it actually does, healing, mitigation, absorption etc"; your call: stack on the deadly moments when a 3rd use would cost one).
// How it decides (notes/Guides/Healing cooldowns - how Debrief assigns them.md):
// 1. The fight's raid damage second by second (the fastest kills, NDZ_TLDMG; your phase times when set). Healers handle the busy
//    stretches up to about the fight's 94th-percentile second without cooldowns (measured on Coiled Altar: 2.5M a second); what goes
