// ---- Raid cooldown plan, top raids first (Oct 24, your asks: "healing cooldown auto assignments need to be reviewed heavily, they are
// terrible", "heavily reference lorrgs.io to see how healing assignments are made"). In order: each cooldown where most top players press it
// (the most agreed moment first, never twice before it's back, two players with the same cooldown on different moments); where top raids
// stack big cooldowns, about as many of ours (the strongest ready one standing in for any we don't have); no bare big hit; every cooldown
