  'Marksmanship Hunter': 11388, 'Demonology Warlock': 10391, 'Fire Mage': 10291, 'Survival Hunter': 9532, 'Unholy Death Knight': 9477, 'Devourer Demon Hunter': 9090, 'Protection Paladin': 8958, 'Beast Mastery Hunter': 8747,
