  const NOISE = /\b(Debrief|is good|are good|or more is|or less is|counts? (as|half|in full)|judged|listed|graded|within \d|Good is|top players|marked|shaded|the times|times below|Close values|the bar|bar is|is enough|counts? when)\b|Wowhead|Icy Veins|SimulationCraft|Raidbots|Method\b|Warcraft Logs|^A window lasts/i;
