// From Wowhead's Preservation Evoker rotation and talent guides for Midnight Season 2 (12.1.5), Icy Veins' rotation, cooldowns and mechanics
// page (12.1.5, read Oct 17 2026), and WoWAnalyzer's Preservation module for 12.1 (github.com/WoWAnalyzer/WoWAnalyzer, the midnight branch: Dream
// Breath, Essence Burst, Emerald Blossom, Echo, Temporal Anomaly, Stasis, Dream Flight and Inner Flame):
//  - Echo: Echo and Temporal Anomaly put Echo buffs on allies; your next healing spell (not Emerald Blossom) is copied to all of them and uses them
//    up. In raid, use them up with Merithra's Blessing (the apex: a Reversion with a big bouncing heal; Dream Breath always grants one), Reversion
//    in a pinch, Verdant Embrace for a big absorb; not with Dream Breath (cast it after the Echoes are spent), and never with Living Flame. An
