//  - Temporal Anomaly on cooldown (Echoes on several allies, and shields). Dream Breath on cooldown at rank 1 (only higher in an emergency), 2
//    charges; each grants a Merithra's Blessing.
//  - Essence: never sit at full. Essence Burst (2 stacks with Essence Attunement): never let one expire or be replaced at 2; spend it on Emerald
//    Blossom (Twin Echoes then doubles your next Echo), on Echo when Twin Echoes already has 2 stacks, on Disintegrate only with Energy Loop. Never
//    cast Emerald Blossom without an Essence Burst (WoWAnalyzer's fail; Icy Veins: too costly).
//  - Stasis: store 2 Dream Breaths at rank 1 and a Temporal Anomaly (Flameshaper; pool both charges), or Dream Breath, Temporal Anomaly and an
