// The bars, set from the top raids: the 32 fastest Mythic Twin Fangs kills on Warcraft Logs (read Oct 18 2026), each spec's players read with these
// same checks. Each line's bar for good sits near the 15th percentile of those players, so the best raiders in the world pass it; its bar for could
// be better sits below that. A line every one of them failed was the check's fault, not theirs, and is left out (drop): Killing Machine, Art of War,
// Shining Light, Surge of Light and Maelstrom Weapon are spent in ways the log doesn't show plainly; Mind Blast's charges and Blood Plague's debuff don't follow their
// listed timers; Retribution's and Subtlety's resource waste, and Devourer's Fury, come mostly from effects they don't control; and Holy Priests end
// this fight with half their mana, so mana isn't graded for them. abc, res, mana: [good, could be better]; set: a line's own values.
